846	/** Settle the selected claims together: the server settles, in list order and by the rules of a single
847	 *  settle, each that can be settled (one sent to PENDING counts) and leaves the rest; the bar shows how
848	 *  many were settled and how many refused (gone while it runs), and the number of the sheet's last
849	 *  batch (a bulk settle that settled at least one; blank when none). */
850	function BulkSettle({ sheetId }: { sheetId: string }) {
