    19	/** The sheet's figures as shown: each person's claimed, due-total and overdue-total, and the sheet's
    20	 *  claimed-total, due-total and overdue-total. A change takes them before it writes, then after its own audit lines records one ROLLUP
    21	 *  line per person whose figures moved (people in list order; a new person counts as
    22	 *  moved), then a TOTALS line when the sheet's totals moved, then, while the sheet has an alert threshold, one ALERT
    23	 *  line per person (in list order) whose due-total went from at or below it (or none) to above it. */
