    20	 *  terms-th business day after its date, skipping Saturdays, Sundays and the holidays on its sheet now, with the
    21	 *  terms it was fixed with. Those terms are the ones in force for it (the person's own, else their grade's on the
    22	 *  date, else the sheet's on the date) when they give its stored calendar due-by (the date plus the terms, moved
    23	 *  past the holidays); else the calendar days from its date to its due-by. */
